Dear all,
Is the default definition of the number of nocturnal sleep episodes in GGIR based on sleep episodes lasting at least 5 minutes, separated by at least 5 seconds of wakefulness within the SPT-window?
I've come across studies where the criterion of '5 seconds of wakefulness' was adjusted to '5 minutes of wakefulness.' I'm interested in understanding how to set parameters in GGIR to specifically obtain the 'number of sleep episodes of at least 5 minutes separated by at least 5 minutes of wakefulness within the SPT-window.'
Your guidance on configuring these parameters would be greatly appreciated. Thank you.

Best regards,

Margaret

