Alex,

You are not specifying the timezone and you show that sleep is happening in the middle of the day. Are you sure your local time zone settings have not changed?
How long is this recording? Just this one day or is it followed by more data?
Can you share the same visualisation for your old output?
What accelerometer brand are you using?
What GGIR version are you using now and what GGIR version where you using before? It sounds like you updated GGIR or the timezone settings of your machine because GGIR does not change itself.
Further, can you share the corresponding RData file form the meta/basic folder? If it is a real bug then this should help us to reproduce it in order to investigate. Please check that you can reproduce the error by processing only that file with GGIR parts 2, 3, 4 and 5.

Vincent

