I have not tried this function with NHANES data, but GGIR recently implemented the function to append accelerometer files with the same ID (the definition of idloc is important for this to work). Please see the argument maxRecordingInterval <https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/GGIR/vignettes/GGIRParameters.html#:~:text=in%20your%20data.-,maxRecordingInterval,-Numeric%20(default%20=%20NULL> to try this out.

Best,
Jairo

